data: {"type":"response.reasoning_summary_text.done","sequence_number":86,"item_id":"rs_059e6d0d3ab0ab8c016ac9f93af3d8819799f6dad77b967445","output_index":0,"summary_index":0,"text":"**Considering migration tests**\n\nI’m wondering if I need to add seed data to existing projects before starting the migration with SQLite. Currently, the tests create an empty schema and seed with no rows, which might not be enough for testing migration thoroughly. I think I should use DatabaseSync for this. I also want to update the final list of summaries and implement an archive lifecycle around completed tasks before stopping and then restoring everything at the end!"}

